[
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# Problem description\n\nThe resource <http://rdfh.ch/0806/eD83lLUSSYCbEOb5B5cknQ> should be deleted from prod,\nbut it cannot be done via API call. \n\nFirst, we have to remove the triples that refer to that resource with SPARQL-operations.\nThen, a regular API call can be done to delete the resource.",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    <http://rdfh.ch/0806/eD83lLUSSYCbEOb5B5cknQ> ?p ?o\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## The resource is in object position of...",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    ?s a ?type ; \n        ?p <http://rdfh.ch/0806/eD83lLUSSYCbEOb5B5cknQ> .\n    OPTIONAL { ?s kb:isDeleted ?deleted }\n    FILTER (?p != rdf:subject)  # exclude reifications, where the resource is in subject position\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Finding: There is 1 resource with 3 links to the resource that we want to delete\n\n1. <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/KMb1IqYDRnmpQyy2dDs_JA>: a deleted LinkValue (predecessor of no. 2)\n2. <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/iZguyd0rRAO1rou7sBFLPA>: a non-deleted LinkValue\n3. <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg>: a richtext value\n\n(1) is the predecessor of (2), but (2) cannot be found in the \n[API response](https://api.dasch.swiss/v2/resources/http%3A%2F%2Frdfh.ch%2F0806%2FTr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA).\n\n### The resource itself is NOT deleted:",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA> a ?type .\n    <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA> kb:isDeleted ?deleted .\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# 1. & 2. The two LinkValues\n\nI assume that I can just erase all triples where they are in subject/object position?",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    {<http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/KMb1IqYDRnmpQyy2dDs_JA> ?p1 ?o1}\n    UNION\n    {?s2 ?p2 <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/KMb1IqYDRnmpQyy2dDs_JA>}\n    UNION\n    {<http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/iZguyd0rRAO1rou7sBFLPA> ?p3 ?o3}\n    UNION\n    {?s4 ?p4 <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/iZguyd0rRAO1rou7sBFLPA>}\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# 3. The richtext value",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## The richtext value is superseded (i.e. has been edited), but not deleted",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT ?successor_val ?successor_val_is_deleted WHERE {\n    ?successor_val kb:previousValue <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg> .\n    ?successor_val kb:isDeleted ?successor_val_is_deleted .\n}\n",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## Property of this value is :hasBiography",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT ?prop WHERE {\n    ?res ?prop <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/kkJEdxkqRjOu6J8eveKR2Q>\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "# What to do with the richtext value?\n\n## 1. Delete all triples where the richtext value is contained",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    {<http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg> ?p1 ?o1} \n    UNION\n    {?s2 ?p2 <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg>}\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## 2. Then, the previous-values-chain has to be closed again\ni.e. <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/kkJEdxkqRjOu6J8eveKR2Q> should be linked to its pre-pre-decessor <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/PQ90XHTUQXm_sBWSNYNJew>",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg> kb:previousValue ?predecessor .\n    ?successor kb:previousValue <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg> .\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "## 3. Delete all triples that contain one of the standoff-tags \n\nThere are 7 standoff tags:",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg> kb:valueHasStandoff ?standoff_tag .\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "And that's how they are interconnected:",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  {
    "kind": 2,
    "language": "sparql",
    "value": "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\nPREFIX kb: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/knora-base#>\nPREFIX webern: <http://www.knora.org/ontology/0806/webern-onto#>\n\nSELECT * WHERE {\n    {<http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg/standoff/0> ?p ?o}\n    UNION\n    {?s ?p <http://rdfh.ch/0806/Tr7j5V37TWOQjNgIJ6VKnA/values/D0z8VcR3Qzi2K2BI3HPXKg/standoff/0>}\n}",
    "metadata": {}
  }
]